396	GeoServer s REST API uses ZIP archives as containers for file formats such as Shapefile and WorldImage which include several boxcar files alongside the main data . In such archives GeoServer assumes that all of the relevant files will have the same base name and appropriate extensions and live in the root of the ZIP archive . This method produces a zip file that matches these expectations based on a basename and a dict of extensions to paths or file - like objects . The client code is responsible for deleting the zip archive when it s done .
